==> 3. POST /exams/dso303-midterm/attempts  (start the timer)
{"attemptId":"1de11418-dfe2-4757-a284-2bd5365778d4","endsAt":"2026-11-15T17:16:18Z","autosaveSeconds":30}

==> 4. Autosave every 30 s: PUT /attempts/1de11418-dfe2-4757-a284-2bd5365778d4/answers  (-> DynamoDB, conditional write)
{"attemptId":"1de11418-dfe2-4757-a284-2bd5365778d4","saved":2,"stale":0,"savedAt":"2026-11-15T16:16:18.864Z"}   <- t=0s
{"attemptId":"1de11418-dfe2-4757-a284-2bd5365778d4","saved":3,"stale":0,"savedAt":"2026-11-15T16:16:18.999Z"}   <- t=30s
Late retry of the t=0s request (must NOT overwrite the newer q2 answer):
{"attemptId":"1de11418-dfe2-4757-a284-2bd5365778d4","saved":0,"stale":1,"savedAt":"2026-11-15T16:16:19.081Z"}

